onlytransits — data & basemap attribution
==========================================

This project renders maps and derives demand data from OpenStreetMap.

Map data
--------
© OpenStreetMap contributors.
Map data is available under the Open Database License (ODbL):
https://www.openstreetmap.org/copyright
https://opendatacommons.org/licenses/odbl/

The in-app basemap and any precomputed demand grid are "Produced Works"
derived from OpenStreetMap data. Visible "© OpenStreetMap contributors"
attribution is rendered on the map at all times via the MapLibre
AttributionControl (this is a release gate, not optional polish).

Basemap tiles / style
---------------------
- Hosted style fallback: © CARTO (https://carto.com/attribution) — Positron
  basemap, © OpenStreetMap contributors.
- Self-hosted vector tiles (deferred T7): Protomaps basemaps
  (https://protomaps.com) built from OpenStreetMap data. Credit:
  "© OpenStreetMap contributors, © Protomaps".

